{"id":"minimum","lemma":"minimum","pos":"noun","rank":2781,"glosses":["minimum"],"ipa":"/mi.ni.mɔm/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/31/Fr-minimum.ogg/Fr-minimum.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"minima"},"formAudio":{"minima":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/08/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-minima.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Le danger est minimum.","en":"The danger is minimal.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"danger"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"On devrait dormir au minimum sept heures par nuit.","en":"We must sleep at least seven hours a day.","words":[{"g":"we / one"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to sleep"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"seven"},{"g":"hour, time","l":"heure"},{"g":"through"},{"g":"night"}]},{"text":"Il n'y a pas de salaire minimum, ici.","en":"There's no minimum wage here.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"salary, wage"},null,{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Je n'ai fait que le strict minimum.","en":"I only did the bare minimum.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"strict"},null]},{"text":"C'est le strict minimum.","en":"That's the bare minimum.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"strict"},null]}]}